    "text": "Given to players at the Guardians Rising prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 22–23 and 29–30 April 2017. Each kit held four Guardians Rising booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Guardians Rising logo. The packs also held a non-holo Mudsdale, a card that is holofoil in booster packs.",
